#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/utility/histogram.rst:47
msgid ""
"This effect/filter computes and draws a color distribution histogram for the "
"input video as an overlay to the clip. Below each graph a color component "
"scale meter is shown."
msgstr ""
"Tento efekt/filter vypočíta a nakreslí histogram farebného rozloženia "
"vstupného videa ako prekrytie klipu. Pod každým grafom je zobrazený merač "
"stupnice farebnej zložky."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/utility/histogram.rst:49
msgid ""
